<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n82216" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περι-στᾰτικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>in critical circumstances</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ π. πράγματα,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιστάσεις</span>
			, <i>critical circumstances</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.169c
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Heliod.
				<u>in EN</u>
				103.17
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἐνοχλήσεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alex.Aphr.
					<u>in Top.</u>
					255.26
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>dependent on circumstances</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καθήκοντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Stoic.</u>
					3.135
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνέργειαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plot.
					1.4.13
				</span></i>
			 ; <i>precarious</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαγωγὴ τοῦ βίου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Max.Tyr.
					36.4
				</span></i>
			. Adv. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῶς</span>
			<i>according to circumstances</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνεργεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plot.
					1.2.7
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>circumstantial, accidental, extraneous</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hierocl.
					<u>in CA</u>
					11p.439M.
				</span></i>
			
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> Rhet., <i>concerned with
				the circumstances</i> of a case, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προοίμια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Corn.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					p.354
				</span></i>
			 H.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μόρια</span> Men.Rh.<i><span class="en">
				p.366
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ὑποκείμενα τῷ διαλόγῳ
			π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>in Prm.</u>
				p.482
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			<i>full of business</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βίος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					6.403
				</span></i>
			 (cj.), <i><span class="en">
				15.177
			</span></i>.</div>
